Hi,

We are setting up a global R-Ladies remote group for R-ladies who do not live near a physical chapter or cannot get to meetings for family reasons.

Details can be found in this tweet:

https://twitter.com/RLadiesRemote/status/963150549301346305

We are currently collecting interest to launch in a few months, so please fill in the form in the twitter post or here: https://goo.gl/BoLrVz and share with anyone you know who might be interested. R-Ladies remote will be a global community for R-ladies from zero R experience to  experienced practitioners.

Thanks

